## 🪜 Steps

```md
1. Download Windows 11 ISO (Microsoft official site)
2. Create bootable USB using Rufus
3. Insert USB into PC
4. Restart and press Boot Key (F12 / ESC / DEL)
5. Select USB device
6. Choose Language → Next
7. Click "Install Now"
8. Enter product key (or Skip)
9. Select edition
10. Choose "Custom: Install Windows only"
11. Select partition → Format (optional)
12. Click Next → Installation starts
13. System will restart automatically
```

💡 **Best for:** Fresh installation, removing viruses, full system reset

